    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "KW TEAM Castles are delighted to welcome this fantastic new property to the Dublin sales market. This excellent two bed ground floor apartment comes to market in pristine condition throughout and being located in one of the most sought after area's in Dublin it is sure to attract attention from both first time buyers and investors.\r\n\r\nThis Bright and spacious internal living accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, family bathroom, living/dining room, kitchen, double bedroom with wardrobes and master en suite, and a secondary bedroom, and is filled with natural light.\r\n\r\nThis superb apartment will be rivalled by few in the market. The property is ideally situated with a wealth of amenities at its doorstep with Drimnagh, Inchicore and Kilmainham villages all within walking distance. These villages offer no shortage of shops, schools, churches, restaurants and bars. In addition, the property is in very close proximity to the Royal Canal, the National Children's Hospital, St. James Hospital, historic Kilmainham Gaol, Heuston Station, Kilmainham Memorial Gardens and the Phoenix Park.There is also no shortage of public transport options in the area with The Luas line passing through, numerous Dublin bus routes and Dublin Bike terminals.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\nExcellent central location\r\n\r\nGFCH\r\n\r\nOff-street parking in a gated private underground car park\r\n\r\nNew gas boiler installed this year that can set remotely with the Hive app\r\n\r\nAbundance of public transport via The Luas and Dublin Bus\r\n\r\nMature neighbourhood\r\n\r\nEasy access to the M50 (2 minute drive)\r\n\r\nSpacious rooms\r\n\r\n15 Minute drive to city centre"
      },
      {
